      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CMake build/test jobs and pip-build/test jobs both run across the shared dev matrix (os x compiler); PyPI wheel jobs run across the release matrix (os x cibw_build).\nReusable workflows and composite actions live in NWChemEx/.github and are shared by every repo in the ecosystem.\nMost repos run test_nwx_pip_build.yaml alongside test_nwx_cmake_build.yaml as a complementary check; nightly.yaml (scheduled) is not shown here.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CMake build/test jobs and pip-build/test jobs both run across the shared dev matrix (os x compiler); PyPI wheel jobs run across the release matrix (os x cibw_build).\nReusable workflows and composite actions live in NWChemEx/.github and are shared by every repo in the ecosystem.\nMost repos run test_nwx_pip_build.yaml alongside test_nwx_cmake_build.yaml as a complementary check; nightly.yaml (scheduled) is not shown here.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
